"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace: Tokyo, Japan"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A man from another world. He had turned twenty without once having done it, so he got concerned."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to a certain incident, he finds himself flung into the parallel world of Laurentide."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he's never gone all the way with a woman before, he finds himself at the center of of a prophecy that is attracting many beautiful suitors. His mission is to have as much baby-making sex as possible!"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c83601"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。一つの運命が終わったかと思ったら、またも別の運命を背負うことになった。その運命とはやっぱり子作りである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"７人の奥様＆お腹には７人の赤ちゃんがいるのに、別の女性と子作りセックスなんて許されるのか…？　と思う人もいるでしょうが、許されます！"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23319","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03aaf3160e64752d80e1e8b2eeec0c3836f468e5742e672fd6be39e053ac7d92.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/449cfed44c6b7cf27143c9fb7bd38495b3332cc6bf3e33581037612e19a04e1c.webp","width":256,"height":100,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c95726","characterName":"ヴァルミューダ・レクザブルツカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92188","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328041"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23312"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95726"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァルミューダ・レクザブルツカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"平均くらい"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Profession: Underworld Princess"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Country: The Underground Empire, Avatar"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Vampire"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: About Average"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Breast size: Big"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There is a vast underground world in this earth. There, a race different from humans prosper and rule....."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The emperor of this dark world wanted the strongest children from his daughter. He heard rumors about the advent of the hero and ordered his daughter to entangle the man."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Valmuda didn't feel like listening to her father's orders, but she was interested in the terrestrial world she hadn't seen yet, and eventually visited Essenbaum. Then, she met the hero."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's the first time I know a man I care about. You're the right man for me to get blood from for the first time.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95726"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"この地球には、広大な地下世界が広がっている。そこでは、地上で繁栄するヒューマンとはまた異なる種族が、支配者となっていた……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"闇の世界の帝王として、彼女の父親は、娘の相手に最強のタネを欲していた。そして、勇者降臨の噂を聞きつけ、その男を籠絡するよう、娘に命じるのだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァルミューダとしては、そんな父親の命令を聞く気などさらさら無かったが、まだ見ぬ地上世界には興味があって、結局、エッセンバウムを訪れることになる。そして、主人公と出会うのだった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23312","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"この地球には、広大な地下世界が広がっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこでは、地上で繁栄するヒューマンとはまた異なる種族が、支配者となっていた……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"闇の世界の帝王として、彼女の父親は、娘の相手に最強のタネを欲していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、勇者降臨の噂を聞きつけ、その男を籠絡するよう、娘に命じるのだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァルミューダとしては、そんな父親の命令を聞く気などさらさら無かったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ見ぬ地上世界には興味があって、結局、エッセンバウムを訪れることになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、主人公と出会うのだった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92188"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92188","value":"闇に君臨する、アヴァタール地下帝国"},{"label":"種族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92188","value":"ヴァンパイア"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92188","value":"王女"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23b9e4c09ed7ac855bf0d464056a948ec3d0ee0115f23976dcafc79e97711b3f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/7321e4000b2fffab2a8648edfb14c41f444899bc4bd86db03bb3b50ca6cd2bd0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎真実","creatorId":"vndb:s199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s199","name":"尾崎 真実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328041:92188:8165:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95727","characterName":"フィオナ・ニーズリック","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92189","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328041"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23313"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95727"},"originalCharacterName":"フィオナ・ニーズリック","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"平均くらい"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Profession: The Hero's Personal Maid"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Country: Between Dimensions, The Keter Underworld"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Demon"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: A bit short"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Breast size: Big"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Keter Underworld exists in a dimensional gap that can only be glimpsed when a born dreamer experiences some kind of alkaloid. People call the creatures that live there demons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the Keter underworld, the king's absence continued for a daunting number of years. That's because the king didn't have the power to materialize, but his reincarnation was finally found. That is the hero."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fiona is sent to the main character as a maid to encourage the king's return. Her body and soul, all for the future king..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Fiona's body and mind is now yours, master. From now on, I will abide by what you want...\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95727"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれついての夢想家が、ある種のアルカロイドを喫した時のみ、垣間見ることのできる次元の狭間。そこに棲まう生き物を、人は魔族と呼ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ケテル冥界では気が遠くなるほどの長い年月、王の不在が続いていた。それは、王にふさわしい力の持ち主が現れなかったからだが、ついに見出すことになる。それが、主人公だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王の帰還を促すべく、フィオナはメイドとして、主人公の元へ遣わされてくる。その身も心も、全ては、未来の王のために……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23313","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれついての夢想家が、ある種のアルカロイドを喫した時のみ、垣間見ることのできる次元の狭間。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこに棲まう生き物を、人は魔族と呼ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ケテル冥界では気が遠くなるほどの長い年月、王の不在が続いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは、王にふさわしい力の持ち主が現れなかったからだが、ついに見出すことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それが、主人公だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王の帰還を促すべく、フィオナはメイドとして、主人公の元へ遣わされてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その身も心も、全ては、未来の王のために……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92189"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92189","value":"次元の狭間、ケテル冥界"},{"label":"種族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92189","value":"魔族"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92189","value":"メイド（主人公専属）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/059cdae2a26b7b82ab58c8430dc52b96dfab31d49f224e6c3b7488d722e514ec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d460ae670d8b686346e962f140b01b90bbcd135a78afdec4a00d8f5c0b36140.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朋永真季","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328041:92189:6351:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95728","characterName":"アンドレア・クキ＝ムラカミ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92190","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328041"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23314"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95728"},"originalCharacterName":"アンドレア・クキ＝ムラカミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"高い方"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Profession: Pirate King"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Country: Leader of the Andrea Pirates"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: Tall"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Breast size: Really Big"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"No law on earth reaches the ocean. The sea belongs to pirates. Andrea is a young woman who has become a builder of her own pirate crew that rules the seven seas. She became the Pirate King not because of her power, but because of her dexterity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She wanted a child to succeed her because peace had come to the sea. However, she is a woman who is afraid of even the rough sea, so it is difficult to get a man and raise a child for long term. For the first time in her life, she decided to go up to ashore. If you're a legendary hero, you might be the right man for her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「I wondered what a land man was like, you arent so bad. I might have become a little interested in having children...」"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95728"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"地上のどんな律法も、大海原には及ばない。海は彼ら海賊のもの。若輩の女性ながら、７つの海の海賊を束ねる棟梁となったアンドレア。彼女が海賊王となったのは、力の故ではなく、その器量のためだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"せっかく海に平和が訪れたのだからと、彼女は跡継ぎの子供を望まれていた。しかし、海の荒くれさえ畏れる女性とあって、なかなか男ができなかった。そこで、生まれて初めて陸に上がってみることにしたのだった。噂の勇者なら、自分にふさわしい男ではないか──そう考えて。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23314","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"地上のどんな律法も、大海原には及ばない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海は彼ら海賊のもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若輩の女性ながら、7つの海の海賊を束ねる棟梁となったアンドレア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女が海賊王となったのは、力の故ではなく、その器量のためだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"せっかく海に平和が訪れたのだからと、彼女は跡継ぎの子供を望まれていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、海の荒くれさえ畏れる女性とあって、なかなか男ができなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで、生まれて初めて陸に上がってみることにしたのだった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"噂の勇者なら、自分にふさわしい男ではないか──そう考えて。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92190"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92190","value":"海賊たちの棟梁、アンドレア海賊団"},{"label":"種族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92190","value":"ヒューマン"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92190","value":"海賊王"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/320b7264b8b866bc89c0009646b4ade62bcd145db3499248d9ead9cd665dfd8f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7fabb0678d21f2d8a12e2b875959e5c649447c7c22bc90977825a68f955a155.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328041:92190:5922:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95729","characterName":"ユピテル・マキシマス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92191","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328041"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23315"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95729"},"originalCharacterName":"ユピテル・マキシマス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"やや高い方"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Profession: Dark Priestess"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From: The Underground Secret Cult, Shaggai"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: A bit tall"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Breast size: Big"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There is an evil cult that worships the evil mystery of the outer universe. She was born and raised in the \"Shaggai Secret Church\". They already knew the advent of the hero who would rule the world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"According to the cult, Yupiter has the highest psychic power in recorded history. She has been raised away from the general congregation in order to obtain the hero's seed. Because it was completely aloof, there is something unique about the her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Why don't we have sex early? This virginity is why I can't hesitate.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95729"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"外宇宙の邪悪なる秘神を崇める、邪教団が人知れず存在する。彼女はその“シャッガイ秘密教団”で産まれ育った。彼らには、世界を支配する鍵となる勇者の降臨が、既に分かっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ユピテルは教団によれば有史以来最高の霊力の持ち主で、そのため、将来は勇者のタネを設けるべく、早くから一般の信徒から遠ざけて育てられてきた。完全に浮世離れしていたために、受け答えにも独特なところがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23315","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"外宇宙の邪悪なる秘神を崇める、邪教団が人知れず存在する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女はその“シャッガイ秘密教団”で産まれ育った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼らには、世界を支配する鍵となる勇者の降臨が、既に分かっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ユピテルは教団によれば有史以来最高の霊力の持ち主で、そのため、将来は勇者のタネを設けるべく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"早くから一般の信徒から遠ざけて育てられてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"完全に浮世離れしていたために、受け答えにも独特なところがある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92191"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92191","value":"地下に蠢く、シャッガイ秘密教団"},{"label":"種族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92191","value":"ヒューマン"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92191","value":"闇の聖職者"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65952abd0e9e982d5f613f6690630f9394e22208cc2bc1b513caad555c55d825.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db73647d741fd99a05bc66d84dd6b06d9abb2301f7d673ac74b0751f581b7ee9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤沢れい香","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328041:92191:32998:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95730","characterName":"ユーガリット","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92192","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328041"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23316"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95730"},"originalCharacterName":"ユーガリット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"やや小さい方"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Profession: Owns the town's repair shop"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Birthplace: The Origin of Civilization, Oriens"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Automata"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: A bit short"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Breast size: Big"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In Oriens, the birthplace of civilization, there is a huge pyramid that cannot be built even with modern technology. The door to the center was protected by a mysterious force that kept thieves at bay."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, the unopened door that seemed to be closed forever opened. What came out of it was an automata (android) made with ultra-ancient technology."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Huh? Can automata give birth to human children?... Why dont you think they can give birth?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I will have your child. That has been decided for 760,000 years....probably.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95730"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文明の発祥の地、オリエンスには、現代の技術をもっても到底建造不可能な、巨大なピラミッドが屹立している。その中心部に至る扉は、不思議な力で守られ、盗人の侵入を拒み続けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日のこと、永遠に閉ざされているかに思えた開かずの扉が、不意に開く。中から出てきたのは、超古代の技術で作られた、オートマタ（人造人間）だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"え？　オートマタがヒューマンの子供を産めるのかって？　……いつから産めないと思っていた？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23316","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文明の発祥の地、オリエンスには、現代の技術をもっても到底建造不可能な、巨大なピラミッドが屹立している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その中心部に至る扉は、不思議な力で守られ、盗人の侵入を拒み続けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日のこと、永遠に閉ざされているかに思えた開かずの扉が、不意に開く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中から出てきたのは、超古代の技術で作られた、オートマタ（人造人間）だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"え？　オートマタがヒューマンの子供を産めるのかって？　……いつから産めないと思っていた？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92192"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92192","value":"文明の源流、オリエンス"},{"label":"種族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92192","value":"オートマタ"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92192","value":"街の修理屋さん"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba71d177775b0006d3ab36572d53ed9092115bfebcc29cd5b7481a4157f5bee7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/7860fba0e10e80850e7b611f02f9513e8fb68591202df9a0a9b77b378cad1d41.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328041:92192:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95731","characterName":"クラリッサ・オルバス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92193","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328041"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23317"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95731"},"originalCharacterName":"クラリッサ・オルバス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"小さい方"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Profession: Runaway Slave"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From: The Evil Organization, Komin-Axis"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: Human"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: A bit short"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Breast size: Big"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Komin-Axis is an unidentified mysterious organization aiming for a world revolution. Curiously, they were kidnapping and collecting girls from all over the world that had some sort of \"birthmarks\" on their bodies. Clarissa, is one of these victims. She was working as a slave for a while."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, Clarissa was lucky enough to escape them. She reached Essenbaum as she continued to flee from the organization's pursuers. There, she met the hero and was saved."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Um, Umm..... Is it fine to refer to you as big brother?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95731"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界同時革命を目論む、正体不明の謎の組織、コミン＝アクシズ。彼らは奇妙なことに、身体にある種の“アザ”がある年頃の少女を、世界中から攫い、集めていた。彼女、クラリッサもその被害者の一人である。そうして、しばらくはドレイとして働かされていたのだが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日、クラリッサは幸運に助けられ、逃亡に成功する。組織が放った追っ手から逃げ続けるうち、彼女はエッセンバウムまで辿り着く。そして、主人公と出会い、救われるのだった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23317","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界同時革命を目論む、正体不明の謎の組織、コミン＝アクシズ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼らは奇妙なことに、身体にある種の“アザ”がある年頃の少女を、世界中から攫い、集めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女、クラリッサもその被害者の一人である。そうして、しばらくはドレイとして働かされていたのだが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日、クラリッサは幸運に助けられ、逃亡に成功する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"組織が放った追っ手から逃げ続けるうち、彼女はエッセンバウムまで辿り着く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、主人公と出会い、救われるのだった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92193"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92193","value":"世界転覆を企む、コミン＝アクシズ"},{"label":"種族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92193","value":"ヒューマン"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92193","value":"逃げたドレイ"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94f7c512a24fca458595d5269686118183be47e08b6898f4093875907ce286d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60f5c13865c6076138d59977b55ea2447e83554118e9bd32b93cb17b8f42ab3b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北村彩","creatorId":"vndb:s912","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s912","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s912","name":"北村 彩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328041:92193:6046:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95732","characterName":"ミュゼー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92194","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328041"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23318"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95732"},"originalCharacterName":"ミュゼー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"神は小さい"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Profession: God does not work"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Country: The Origin of Mankind, Gaia"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Race: God of Destruction"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: God is small"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Breast size: God is small"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gaia, the birthplace of humankind, has become a dark and desolate which keeps people away due to the subsequent climate change. Deep in this dark land, a great mage kept praying to the earth. Finally, in exchange for his life, he summoned the god of destruction. But the destructive god was...small."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Originally, she couldn't wake up until 100 million years had passed, but it seems that this happened for unusual reasons. Because she is small, she does not have her original destructive power. However, after waking up, she decided to have a great child with the hero so she can destroy the world with it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Okay, I will give birth to your child. That's the duty of a god of destruction.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95732"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人類誕生の地ながら、その後の気候変動で、人を寄せ付けない暗黒の魔境となった土地、ガイア。その暗黒の地の奥深くで、とある大魔道士が、大地に祈り続けていた……。そしてとうとう、命と引き替えに、破壊神を召喚してしまう。だがその破壊神は──小さかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来、あと１億年は経たないと目覚めないところが、半端なところで起こされたために、そのようなことになったらしい。小さいために、本来の力もない。が、目覚めたからには、とりあえず地球を破壊しておこうと、主人公の子供を宿すことに決めるのだった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23318","sourceWorkId":"30597","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人類誕生の地ながら、その後の気候変動で、人を寄せ付けない暗黒の魔境となった土地、ガイア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その暗黒の地の奥深くで、とある大魔道士が、大地に祈り続けていた……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてとうとう、命と引き替えに、破壊神を召喚してしまう。だがその破壊神は──小さかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来、あと1億年は経たないと目覚めないところが、半端なところで起こされたために、そのようなことになったらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さいために、本来の力もない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、目覚めたからには、とりあえず地球を破壊しておこうと、主人公の子供を宿すことに決めるのだった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92194"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"出身","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92194","value":"人類誕生の地、ガイア"},{"label":"種族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92194","value":"はかい神"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92194","value":"神は働かない"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d1abf3b3930f86df2a9b516df4cd60324a1f7e46f1a5b9841bb06ef35893684.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/715bd4e6b3812c29e464e793e05f827660089d7151b71fead0a3fd10ce096a30.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"結城ほのか","creatorId":"vndb:s6018","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6018","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6018","name":"結城 ほのか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:328041:92194:20256:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90016","characterName":"ジョシュア・ハイリッテ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c90016"},"originalCharacterName":"ジョシュア・ハイリッテ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/6567fa18a0ea5831467c1c677266a41d96c8a7a5d51f56670abcb4188cf5956d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/2022d69b5974c35c6468b0c054e3d8cc4ffae7c4da2c787e614a3053094a1b6d.webp","width":196,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐藤 涼樹","creatorId":"vndb:s732","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s732","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s732","name":"四宮 豪","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:86424","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c90019","characterName":"ポ